      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIGER EUPHEME (1) is improving with racing this time in and looks ready to deliver after leading from wider and sticking on as runner-up here last week, beaten 1.1 metres. Has the gate speed to take advantage of the ace draw so can go one better this time around. AMERICAN BOXER (6) has been coming from the back line of late and did well when beaten just a neck into second here two back. Up to a distance where he has recorded a win and two placings from four attempts. Big chance. CASE FORTY EIGHT (3) is another that has had second row draws of late and was beaten only 3.3m when runner-up here two back. Well served by this better barrier. RIPSTONE SNORTER (5) will be fitter for recent racing so can make an impact.",
